{"65263bf9-4f87-4513-b72f-ad6436b3911c":{"id":"65263bf9-4f87-4513-b72f-ad6436b3911c","title":"Wotaku ni Koi wa Muzukashii","altTitle":"Wotakoi: Love Is Hard for Otaku","description":"Kisah percintaan Narumi Momose amat sulit. Dia diputuskan oleh pacarnya setelah sang pacar tahu kalau Narumi adalah fujoshi. Akhirnya dia memutuskan untuk pindah kerja dan menyembunyikan kenyataan kalau dirinya seorang otaku di kantor barunya. Tapi di tempat kerja barunya dia malah bertemu dengan Hirotaka Nifuji, teman masa kecilnya yang tampan dan terampil tapi otaku gamer kelas berat. Mendengar keluhan Narumi mengenai otaku yang tidak akan berhasil dalam cinta, Hirotaka pun mengajak Narumi berpacaran sebagai sesama otaku!? “Kalau aku pasti akan menemanimu mengumpulkan material atau naik level. Aku nggak akan mengecewakanmu atau membuatmu menangis Ditambah lagi, aku bisa membantumu berjualan di comiket akhir pekan minggu depan.","year":2014,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"86","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/65263bf9-4f87-4513-b72f-ad6436b3911c/b7f78e11-c910-48bb-a842-798e04f0f92f.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["ru","uk","pt-br","id","es-la","en","es","vi","tr"],"lane":"manga","rating":9.08,"follows":77939,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:15.312Z","chapters":[{"id":"f3aa6a08-8f20-47d6-8b8f-7274a8ae7dea","number":"86","volume":"11","title":"Chapter 86 + Afterword","lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2022-04-04T14:49:01+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"4c0717cc-3cdc-4b42-adfa-cac3942b6b55","number":"85","volume":"11","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2022-04-04T14:40:39+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"bd0a9258-f785-4d00-9cde-58c1507caaeb","number":"84","volume":"11","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":31,"createdAt":"2022-04-04T14:33:20+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"64769656-c273-451f-bdbb-6ea42eb8172f","number":"83","volume":"11","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"202